 class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Building\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Building</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Magma Cave Shop</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.52.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">March 15th, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>Raffina Caldera</b> is an NPC who runs the <a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Cave_Shop\" title=\"Magma Cave Shop\">Magma Cave Shop</a> located in the <a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Caves\" title=\"Magma Caves\">Magma Caves</a>. \n</p><p><b>Raffina Caldera</b> has a very similar appearance to <a href=\"/wiki/Lumi_Laurence\" title=\"Lumi Laurence\">Lumi Laurence</a> (the NPC who runs the <a href=\"/wiki/River_Shop\" title=\"River Shop\">River Store</a>). Both of them are non-human.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<p><b>= These messages below are according to both Lumi's and Raffina's creator, Ponna.</b>\n</p><p>- Raffina Caldera species is the same as <a href=\"/wiki/Lumi_Laurence\" title=\"Lumi Laurence\">Lumi Laurence</a> which is Ancient Golem.\n</p><p>- Raffina Caldera likes Hot magma-related stuff and Rock Metal music.\n</p><p>- Raffina Caldera hobbies are playing electric guitar and listening to music.\n</p><p>- Raffina Caldera hates her ex-boyfriend, <a href=\"/wiki/Lumi_Laurence\" title=\"Lumi Laurence\">Lumi Laurence</a>, and anything related to cold or water.\n</p><p>- Raffina is female and her age in human years is around 20-30 years old.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Concept_Art\">Concept Art</span></h2>\n<p>These concepts below were made by <b>Ponna</b>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"0fbd8161c38d636aa1e8c87c1fe4fa2d\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Raffina_Caldera_Concept1-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:138px; top:0.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Raffina_Caldera_Concept1.png\" title=\"Raffina Caldera Concept1.png (88 KB)\" style=\"height:184px; width:138px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/74/Raffina_Caldera_Concept1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/139?cb=20240328141638\" title=\"Raffina Caldera Concept1.png (88 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Raffina Caldera Concept1.png\" data-image-key=\"Raffina_Caldera_Concept1.png\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Raffina Caldera Concept1.png (88 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Raffina Caldera Concept1.png\" data-image-key=\"Raffina_Caldera_Concept1.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/74/Raffina_Caldera_Concept1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/139?cb=20240328141638\" /></a></div></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; font-size:90%\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template:NPC_Nav\" title=\"Template:NPC Nav\"><span title=\"View this template\">v</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template_talk:NPC_Nav\"><span title=\"Discuss this template\">d</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template:NPC_Nav?action=edit\"><span title=\"Edit this template\">e</span></a></span><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oaklands\" title=\"Oaklands Wiki\"><img alt=\"Oaklands Wiki\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e6/Site-logo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/115?cb=20221025233312\" decodi